# Drop-in background artwork for Explore-theme cards (DiscoverPage theme grid).
# Name a file by the topic slug, e.g. roman_empire.jpg / punic_wars.png.
# Supported formats resolve in this order: webp -> png -> jpg -> jpeg.
# The card shows the image as a background only when present; without it the
# card keeps its plain paper style. Keep this file so the (empty) directory is tracked.
